# Title: Exchange PowerShell Snap-Ins Usage
# ID: 25676e10-2121-446e-80a4-71ff8506af47
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: FPT.EagleEye, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-03-03
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001, attack.collection, attack.t1114
# Description: Detects adding and using Exchange PowerShell snap-ins to export mailbox data. As seen used by HAFNIUM and APT27
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_exec="*Add-PSSnapin*") AND (((process_path="*\\powershell.exe" OR process_path="*\\pwsh.exe")) OR ((process_name="PowerShell.EXE" OR process_name="pwsh.dll"))) AND ((process_exec="*Microsoft.Exchange.Powershell.Snapin*" OR process_exec="*Microsoft.Exchange.Management.PowerShell.SnapIn*"))) AND NOT ((parent_process_path="C:\\Windows\\System32\\msiexec.exe" AND process_exec="*$exserver=Get-ExchangeServer ([Environment]::MachineName) -ErrorVariable exerr 2> $null*")))
